<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: arcane plant pot -->
  <VV_ArcanePlantPot.label>神秘植物栽培盆</VV_ArcanePlantPot.label>
  <!-- EN: a pot that can hold arcane plants. It is typically used to place arcane plants indoors or in locations where normal plants can't grow.\n\nIf an arcane plant in the pot is attacked, the pot will absorb the damage first unless it's an flame damage. If the pot is destroyed, the arcane plant will automatically be packed up. -->
  <VV_ArcanePlantPot.description>一个可以种植神秘植物的盆。通常用于将神秘植物种植在室内或其他植物无法生长的地方。\n\n若盆中的神秘植物被攻击，盆会替植物吸收伤害（除非是火焰伤害）。若盆被摧毁，盆中的神秘植物会自动打包。</VV_ArcanePlantPot.description>
  
  <!-- EN: large arcane plant pot -->
  <VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.label>大型神秘植物栽培盆</VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.label>
  <!-- EN: a large pot used for cultivating arcane seedlings. It can hold a large amount of fertilizer and automatically manages the nutrient levels of the seedlings on the farm with high efficiency.\n\nGrown arcane plants can also be planted in the cultivation bed, making it useful as a large pot for planting multiple arcane plants indoors at once. -->
  <VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.description>用于培育神秘植物幼苗的大盆，可以容纳大量的肥料并自动高效地管理幼苗的营养等级。\n\n成体神秘植物也可被移栽到育苗床上，使其能有效地在室内培植数株神秘植物。</VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.description>
  <!-- EN: Mana Fertilizer -->
  <VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>魔能肥料</VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Mana Fertilizer -->
  <VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>魔能肥料</VV_LargeArcanePlantPot.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: mana emitter -->
  <VV_ManaEmitter.label>魔能放射器</VV_ManaEmitter.label>
  <!-- EN: A device that extracts inactive mana contained in mana fertilizer and converts it into environment mana. When mana fertilizer is inserted, it slowly transforms it into environment mana and disperses it for use nearby.\n\nIts conversion efficiency is low, but it's useful when mana production is insufficient or in need of an emergency supply, making it an essential device used by the Vivi when establishing a hive. -->
  <VV_ManaEmitter.description>一种提取魔法肥料中不活跃的魔能并将其转化为环境魔能的装置。当注入魔法肥料时，它会慢慢将其转化为环境中的魔能，并将其分散给附近的神秘植物使用。\n\n它的转换效率很低，但当法力产生不足或需要紧急供应时，它很有用，这使其成为薇薇在建立蜂巢时使用的重要设备。</VV_ManaEmitter.description>
  <!-- EN: Mana Fertilizer -->
  <VV_ManaEmitter.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>魔能肥料</VV_ManaEmitter.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Mana Fertilizer -->
  <VV_ManaEmitter.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>魔能肥料</VV_ManaEmitter.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: shock net trap -->
  <VV_ShockNetTrap.label>电网陷阱</VV_ShockNetTrap.label>
  <!-- EN: An electrified net trap. Stepping on it releases a small EMP that temporarily disables machines, while living targets are briefly stunned by a pulse of current. It must stay powered, and although it can be reused after triggering, it requires time to recharge. -->
  <VV_ShockNetTrap.description>一个带电的网状陷阱，被踩下时会发出小型电磁脉冲晕眩机械体，或短暂击晕活体目标。陷阱必须保持供电，且在一定时间的充电后能重复使用。</VV_ShockNetTrap.description>
  
  <!-- EN: waterdrop lamp -->
  <VV_WaterdropLamp.label>滴水灯</VV_WaterdropLamp.label>
  <!-- EN: a wall lamp decoration shaped like a Waterdrops flower. It emits light and illuminates the surroundings when it absorbs a small amount of environment mana. -->
  <VV_WaterdropLamp.description>一盏形状像滴水兰花的墙灯，吸收少量环境魔能的同时能照亮周围。</VV_WaterdropLamp.description>
  
</LanguageData>